Third-party material
--------------------

`patches/` and `cases/*/patch.diff` contain diff text against upstream
components (cJSON, curl, ffmpeg, OpenSSL, OpenHarmony). Those files are
derivative works of their upstream projects and remain under the upstream
licences (MIT, curl, LGPL/GPL as applicable, Apache-2.0). This project's MIT
licence covers the analysis code, the reports and the harnesses, not the
upstream code those patches quote.

`kb/` contains CVE record metadata derived from the public cvelistV5 feed,
which is distributed under CC-BY-4.0.
